\newlabel{fig:heatmap_results}{{7}{8}{\textbf {Performance heatmap across 5 benchmarks.} Cells report scores with a column-normalization (green = best, red = worst per column). NI = NoInstruct, I = Instruct. \textsc {CITA}\_I achieves the highest AQI (55.0) while remaining competitive across switching metrics. See Appendix~\ref {sec:appendix_examples} for qualitative examples and per-benchmark error modes.\relax }{figure.caption.28}{}}
